  select 'e0530000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 0, $q$cortona$q$, $q$June 20$q$, $q$Arrival$q$, $q$A private transfer brings you from Florence airport to the palace in Cortona, about an hour and a half away, and you arrive in the early afternoon. The rest of the day is yours: time to settle in, then a first walk through Cortona's steep lanes, with the Val di Chiana opening below the town walls.$q$, 0, $q$experience$q$, $q$["fotos/tl053/transfer.jpg"]$q$::jsonb, null, null, null, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, null, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, 1, null, false
