  select 'e0530000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 3, $q$cortona$q$, $q$June 23$q$, $q$Arezzo$q$, $q$Arezzo's goldsmiths have been at work for centuries. Start with the old town and Piazza Grande; the goldsmith experience takes place nearby. We are shaping a proposal around Emily's request and will share it soon.$q$, 0, $q$experience$q$, $q$["fotos/tl053/arezzo.jpg#p=50,55"]$q$::jsonb, null, $q$lunch.$q$, null, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, null, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, 1, null, false
