  select 'e0530000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 4, $q$cortona$q$, $q$June 24$q$, $q$A day of your own$q$, $q$Time at the palace, or a drive into Umbria, just across the valley: Orvieto on its cliff of tuff, and Deruta, known for its ceramics. On request, our concierge can arrange a visit to a ceramics workshop there, even a piece made for you to take home, subject to availability.$q$, 0, $q$experience$q$, $q$["fotos/tl053/orvieto.jpg"]$q$::jsonb, null, $q$lunch.$q$, null, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, null, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, 1, null, false
