  select 'e0530000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 6, $q$castelfalfi$q$, $q$June 26$q$, $q$Truffles$q$, $q$Into the woods with a truffle hunter and his dogs, following the hunt up close as they search the forest floor. Then you sit down to a lunch of truffle-based dishes and a full tasting of their products.$q$, 710, $q$experience$q$, $q$["fotos/tl053/trufas.jpg#p=50,40"]$q$::jsonb, $q$the truffle hunt, lunch and the tasting.$q$, null, null, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, null, $q$[{"key": "transp", "label_pt": "Transporte privativo de ida e volta para a caça às trufas", "label_en": "Private transport to and from the truffle hunt", "price": 790}]$q$::jsonb, 1, null, false
