  select 'e0530000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 24, $q$dining$q$, $q$$q$, $q$Dining concierge$q$, $q$Lunch and dinner are left open across your days, so the choice remains yours. If you would prefer to leave it to us, our team prepares a considered selection for each day and sends it for your approval, then secures the reservations on your behalf, always according to availability. The most sought-after tables are held months in advance, while smaller, local places can be arranged in the weeks before you travel. If you would rather arrange it yourselves, we recommend reserving the days that matter most to you well ahead, whether through your hotel or the restaurants directly, as tables are limited in high season.$q$, 420, $q$extra$q$, $q$["fotos/tl053/jantar.jpg"]$q$::jsonb, null, null, null, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, null, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, 6, 70, false
